msgstr "Kaméra nu dipilih teu bisa dibuka"

#: src/onboarding.py:582
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Coba pilih anu sanés"

#: src/onboarding.py:597
msgid ""
"Please visit\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"to enable your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Mangga didatangan\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"pikeun ngaktipkeun emitter ir Anjeun"

#: src/onboarding.py:665
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Persiapan cahaya 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:666
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Persiapan cahaya 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Teu bisa nyimpen model beungeut"

#: src/onboarding.py:712 src/onboarding.py:759
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Pindai modél kadua"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Teu bisa ngarekam modél kadua"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Modél munggaran anjeun disimpen, janten login raray parantos jalan. Kamar "
"kudu tetep cukup caang pikeun nempo beungeut anjeun - ngarobah lampu "
"tinimbang mareuman - lajeng cobian deui, atawa skip tur nambahkeun model "
"engké ti Setélan."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Pamindaian kadua: kacamata, kumis atanapi cahaya beda"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"Modél kahiji geus disimpen: asup nganggo beungeut geus tiasa. Modél kadua "
"ngajantenkeun pangenalan langkung tiasa dipercaya upami aya anu robih: "
"pasang kacamata anu kadang anjeun anggo (atanapi cabut), rékam nganggo kumis "
"beda, sareng robih cahaya — hurungkeun atanapi pareuman lampu, jauhan tina "
"jandéla. Tetepkeun beungeut katingali jelas sareng pencét Pindai deui; "
"rékaman pondok anu dipandu anu sami bakal nuturkeun."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tiasa otomatis muka konci {} anjeun nganggo auténtikasi raray "
"(dompét anu dideteksi: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Mariksa hardware sareng alat TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tiasa otomatis muka konci {} anjeun nganggo auténtikasi raray "
"(dompét anu dideteksi: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Parangkat keras TPM dideteksi. Masang <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"otomatis..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tiasa otomatis muka konci {} anjeun nganggo auténtikasi raray "
"(dompét anu dideteksi: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 aktip. Sandi anjeun bakal disegel aman "
"di jero TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tiasa otomatis muka konci {} anjeun nganggo auténtikasi raray "
"(dompét anu dideteksi: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Parangkat keras TPM dideteksi, tapi pamasangan otomatis "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> gagal. Jalankeun <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Ragrag deui kana cache credential basis software."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tiasa otomatis muka konci {} anjeun nganggo auténtikasi raray "
"(dompét anu dideteksi: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Taya hardware TPM nu dideteksi. Ngagunakeun cache "
"credential basis software (AES-256-GCM)."

