#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Potret raray anjeun anu Ubuntu Hello dibandingkeun. Tetep sahenteuna dua, "
"dirékam dina cahaya béda."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Némbongkeun modél anu disimpen pikeun:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Ngan hiji modél beungeut anu kadaptar. Kacamata, parobahan kumis atanapi "
"cahaya beda ngarobih cara kaméra ningali beungeut anjeun, janten hiji modél "
"tiasa gagal (contona wanci sonten di handapeun lampu). Tambihkeun modél "
"kadua nganggo atanapi tanpa kacamata, penampilan anjeun anu sanés, atanapi "
"dina cahaya beda supados muka konci tetep tiasa dipercaya."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Tambahkeun model kadua"

