#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Bewara desktop nembongkeun bari Ubuntu Hello néangan beungeut anjeun, teras "
"ngalaporkeun hasilna. Usaha anu gagal tetep dina daptar béwara."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Témbongkeun béwara"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Hiji kartu per usaha raray-auténtikasi, diropéa di tempat kalawan hasilna."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Sora béwara"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Maén sora sistem pikeun dipikawanoh atawa gagal usaha ."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Kaasup diagnostics"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkeun model, kapastian vs bangbarung, pigura, kaméra jeung timing ka "
"unggal kartu. Mangpaat nalika ngalaporkeun masalah."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Kaamanan"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Sakumaha pasna beungeut anjeun kedah cocog, sareng naha Ubuntu Hello bakal "
"ménta anjeun mastikeun yén anjeun leres-leres aya di payuneun kaméra."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Tingkat ketatna cocog beungeut"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Gancang"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Saimbang"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Aman"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Ménta kuring unggeuk pikeun mastikeun"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Saatos beungeut anjeun cocog, aya béwara anu ménta anjeun unggeuk. Poto anu "
"dicekel hareupeun kaméra moal bisa unggeuk."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Otomatis-Buka Konci"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktipkeun auténtikasi raray pikeun muka konci keyring login anjeun atanapi "
"KWallet sacara otomatis nalika login. Ieu nyimpen kecap akses anjeun kalayan "
"aman — disegel dina TPM upami sayogi, atanapi diénkripsi nganggo AES-256-GCM "
"ku konci utama anu ngan tiasa diaksés ku root. Auténtikasi raray nyetél "
"PAM_AUTHTOK pikeun pam_gnome_keyring atanapi pam_kwallet5, gumantung kana "
"desktop anjeun."

